#paritta[#metadata((tipo: "primera-linea", texto: "Aniccā vata saṅkhārā")) <primera-linea>
Aniccā vata saṅkhārā #linebreak() 
Uppāda-vaya-dhammino #linebreak() 
Uppajjitvā nirujjhanti #linebreak() 
Tesaṁ vūpasamo sukho

Sabbe sattā maranti ca #linebreak() 
Mariṁsu ca marissare #linebreak() 
Tath'evāhaṁ marissāmi #linebreak() 
N'atthi me ettha saṁsayo

]

